# Charming Prince, third mode: "Exile another target creature you own. Return it to the battlefield under your control at the beginning of
# the next end step." Bot1's Savannah Lions is exiled until the end step and is back on the battlefield then. The Prince itself is not
# "another" creature and Bot2's Memnite is not one Bot1 owns: both are refused as targets (CR 115.1); Bot1's own Memnite (also a
# creature it owns, and one with nothing else to tell it apart) is a legal choice, so the Lions is picked from two. The Lions is in
# exile in the second main phase, Bot1's Memnite stays, and no life is gained (CR 700.2).

